  "important_findings": [
    "Full-sequence pooled20-finger prediction-only D2 p95 is MP29.122/26.741, raw48.742/43.630, smoothed37.053/30.956 native estimated mm/frame^2(left/right). Smoothing improves its own raw result but remains above currentMP globally. This is not reference-relative acceleration error.",
    "Late frozen window680-850 has smoothed pooledD2 p95 25.286/24.292 versus MP25.647/24.641 native mm/frame^2. Do not claim every local interval is worse; this small descriptive crossover is not independent accuracy or grasp acceptance.",
    "All native opening curves have variation. Raw/smoothed full3D opening ranges exceed currentMP, but greater or smaller range alone cannot identify true grasp motion.",
    "The2D normalized opening proxy becomes unstable under nearly edge-on or noisy palm endpoints: accepted right palm width0.120178px at356 yields thumb/indexratio79.048; accepted left width0.501417px at763 yields15.096. Keep these diagnostics but do not interpret them as true angles or rank hand accuracy from their mean alone. No ad-hoc cutoff was applied.",
    "Raw generated-target finger and wrist guards have0/1750 failures with2 unknown edges. Smoothed generated fingers have0/1752 failures but generated wrist guards have4 failures. This differs from EP16 and prevents a blanket zero-failure claim.",
    "At left511-to512, the smoothed-driven nativeMHR per-frame mean finger step is13.230mm versus raw5.088 and currentMP4.725. At right558-to559 it is12.994mm versus raw6.758/currentMP4.124. Whole-sequence smoothing does not guarantee each downstream fitted edge improves; these remain prediction-only changes without true motion labels.",
    "Source montage shows visible but blurred left hand at803 despite zero acceptedMP landmarks. Missing detector evidence is not a reliable true-occlusion label; the511-to512 support swap also must not be called an occlusion transition without image review."
  ],
  "unchanged_limits": [
    "Generated EgoHand projections are inferred targets, not independent image observations or hidden-hand truth. Geometric confidence does not establish visibility.",
    "The same original holdout IDs have zero image fitting weights, but upstream whole-clip smoothing mixes raw estimates at these times into neighboring filtered targets. Generated smoothed holdout is development consistency, not independent held-out accuracy.",
    "Native identity, scales, root and unselected controls are preserved; selected finger/arm/wrist controls change. Decoder consistency and baseline-relative engineering passes do not establish reconstruction correctness.",
    "The mesh overlay has no object depth/occlusion test. Human triangles drawn over the table are not evidence of penetration.",
    "Critical candidate JPEGs511/512/559/560/803 still need static QA; no continuous playback or true phase/timing/contact assessment has been performed by this reviewer."
